mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">1</mn></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">0</mn></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>: sliding the whole chain\nsideways stretches nothing.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>","file":"ch24-applied/09-vibrations.html"}